  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_01",
      "hash64": "7074FF3D9FB33172",
      "text": "M[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0707)]on chera chère [VAR 0x0100(0000)] !\\nJe suis ravi de te voir ![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0707"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_02",
      "hash64": "7074FE3D9FB32FBF",
      "text": "Tu es venu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e ici pour prendre ton repas, toi aussi ?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_select_01",
      "hash64": "41E2A3C4A8BB79C1",
      "text": "Exactement.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_select_02",
      "hash64": "41E2A0C4A8BB74A8",
      "text": "Non, je passais juste comme ça.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_03a",
      "hash64": "C9F8BCB65D77E337",
      "text": "Très bonne idée. Après tout, il est déconseillé\\nde se battre le ventre vide.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_03b",
      "hash64": "C9F8BDB65D77E4EA",
      "text": "Peut-être que tu as été inconsciemment attiré[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e\\npar la bonne odeur qui se dégage d’ici.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_04",
      "hash64": "7074FC3D9FB32C59",
      "text": "En ce qui me concerne, disons que je suis là\\npour... inspecter la cafétéria.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_05",
      "hash64": "7074FB3D9FB32AA6",
      "text": "J’essaie de faire attention à ce que mangent\\nles élèves, pour m’assurer que c’est équilibré.\\r\\nC’est la seule raison de ma présence.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_06",
      "hash64": "7074FA3D9FB328F3",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, je vais commencer par regarder\\nde près le Sandwich au beurre de cacahuètes.\\r\\nOn dit qu’il est sucré et délicieux.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_07",
      "hash64": "7074F93D9FB32740",
      "text": "Je vais en commander un... Pour voir s’il remplit\\ntoutes les exigences nutritionnelles, bien sûr ![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_mob_01",
      "hash64": "72BB0B4A3B889909",
      "text": "Oh, regardez, c’est monsieur Saguaro !\\nQuelle classe ! Il est toujours bien habillé !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_mob_02",
      "hash64": "72BB084A3B8893F0",
      "text": "Faut croire que les profs mangent aussi\\nà la cafétéria, des fois.\\r\\nJe parie qu’il va prendre un Sandwich à l’œuf !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_mob_03",
      "hash64": "72BB094A3B8895A3",
      "text": "Mais non ! À mon avis, il est plutôt du genre\\nà aimer les plats bien épicés ! Je pense\\r\\nqu’il va prendre un Sandwich relevé !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_mob_04",
      "hash64": "72BB0E4A3B889E22",
      "text": "Ouais, t’as raison, c’est sûr !\\nÇa, c’est un plat stylé pour les vrais adultes !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_08",
      "hash64": "7075083D9FB340BD",
      "text": "...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_09",
      "hash64": "7075073D9FB33F0A",
      "text": "Je, euh... je vais prendre un Sandwich relevé,\\ns’il vous plaît.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_select_03",
      "hash64": "41E2A1C4A8BB765B",
      "text": "Mais, monsieur ?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_select_04",
      "hash64": "41E2A6C4A8BB7EDA",
      "text": "Et le beurre de cacahuètes ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_10",
      "hash64": "7071FA3D9FB0F31C",
      "text": "Oh là là, où ai-je la tête ? Il est vrai que tu m’as\\nproposé de goûter le Sandwich au beurre\\r\\nde cacahuètes, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]...\\c\\nBon, puisque c’est apparemment important\\npour toi, je vais en prendre un.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 195,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_11",
      "hash64": "7071FB3D9FB0F4CF",
      "text": "Ouf... Moi qui ai horreur de la nourriture épicée...\\nJ’ai failli me retrouver dans de beaux draps.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_12",
      "hash64": "7071FC3D9FB0F682",
      "text": "Je te remercie d’être intervenu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e pour m’aider\\ndans cette délicate situation, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_13",
      "hash64": "7071FD3D9FB0F835",
      "text": "Je crois que les élèves ont tendance à me voir\\ncomme une sorte de dandy un peu rebelle\\r\\net dur à cuir...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_14",
      "hash64": "7071F63D9FB0EC50",
      "text": "Malheureusement, j’ai tendance à me comporter\\nde la sorte autour d’eux, afin de ne pas écorner\\r\\ncette image idéalisée qu’ils se font de moi...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_15",
      "hash64": "7071F73D9FB0EE03",
      "text": "Mais je me suis montré à toi sous mon vrai jour,\\nalors que je n’en avais pas l’intention...\\c\\nJe compte sur toi pour garder cela secret.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_system_01",
      "hash64": "1F8785FE16DAD786",
      "text": "Vous êtes devenu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e encore plus proche\\nde monsieur Saguaro !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
